{"4555010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hypocrisy", "steam_appid": 4555010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555010/extras/dc16fe36b3581d5d3bc17e3b2c803ea0.avif?t=1784673936\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span>In a world ruled by a despotic regime, you are its next victim. Having lost your family, your life, and your dreams, you hunt the tyrant who took it all from you. Consumed by vengeance, you claim to fight for justice and save the world, but each step drags you deeper into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you shatter the mask of a hero, or lie to yourself to be the one the world needs?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend six vertical worlds, each ruled by an enemy of the soul — Wrath, Desire, Greed, Obsession, Envy, Pride. A narrative-driven roguelite with eight companions, mature characters, and a sci-fantasy universe built on depth and contrast.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555010/extras/dc16fe36b3581d5d3bc17e3b2c803ea0.avif?t=1784673936\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span>In a world ruled by a despotic regime, you are its next victim. Having lost your family, your life, and your dreams, you hunt the tyrant who took it all from you. Consumed by vengeance, you claim to fight for justice and save the world, but each step drags you deeper into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you shatter the mask of a hero, or lie to yourself to be the one the world needs?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend six vertical worlds, each ruled by an enemy of the soul — Wrath, Desire, Greed, Obsession, Envy, Pride. A narrative-driven roguelite with eight companions, mature characters, and a sci-fantasy universe built on depth and contrast.</p>", "short_description": "Hunt a tyrant, liberate oppressed worlds, face the monster within — in a sci-fantasy action roguelike RPG.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555010/ee0f3753c4e28ed1abde90037ead321d7b9c9e45/header.jpg?t=1784673936", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555010/b4109399270ebc29b6d3e6cb8501bb808b84b71e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784673936", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555010/b4109399270ebc29b6d3e6cb8501bb808b84b71e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784673936", "website": "https://atmagaming.com/hypocrisy", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (version 1909 or later)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti (2 GB) / AMD Radeon R7 260X / Intel Iris Xe<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible (any onboard audio)<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> None<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p @ 30 FPS on Low. SSD recommended.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (6 GB) / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 MB avai